# rust-std cross-compilation is disabled for this board (see BOARD_RUSTFLAGS
# in board.conf / sandbox.rs setup_crossdev): dev-lang/rust from source needs
# ~9.6GB of tmpfs to bootstrap, which a RAM-constrained build host may not
# have. dev-vcs/git's "rust" USE flag is on by default and builds a Rust
# component ("gitcore") that needs the armv7a rust-std target, so it fails
# with "can't find crate for `std`" unless explicitly disabled here.
dev-vcs/git -rust
